# The whole project runs WITHOUT any of this (smart rule-based fallback).
# To switch the AI layer on with a FREE model, copy this file to ".env" and set ONE of these.
#
# ── Option A: Groq (recommended — free, no card, very fast) ──────────────────
#   Get a free key at https://console.groq.com  →  API Keys
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_key_here
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
#
# ── Option B: Google Gemini (free tier) ─────────────────────────────────────
#   Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
#
# ── Option C: Ollama (fully local, free, offline — needs `ollama` installed) ─
#   Install from https://ollama.com , then:  ollama pull llama3.2
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.2
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
#
# (Anthropic also works if you prefer: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / ANTHROPIC_MODEL)
